              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la angustia — \"anguish, distress\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sentí angustia al no tener noticias. I felt anguish at having no news."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Me da angustia — it makes me anxious."
            }
          ]
